	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Recepi sacrae maiestatis vestrae literas clementia regia <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>planerefertissimas, quo nomine immortales <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>eidem vestrae clementiae gratias ago, deum autem patrem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nostrum oro per unigenitum filium eius Iesum Christum, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ut R.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">V. M. non tantum in felici statu conservet ei<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>demque pacem, authoritatem, opes, victorias atque <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>reliqua bona temporalia concedat, sed oculos mentis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>R. V. M. illuminatos in se solo retineat, ne alio <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>spectent quam ad ipsum solum, qui in veracissimo <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>evangelio clamat: "Ego sum lux mundi; qui sequitur me, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>non ambulabit in tenebris, sed habebit lumen <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vitae."</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Varae quidem effundunt sese ex sapientia <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>humana et cacodaemonis versutia nebulae <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ad obtenebrandam hanc lucem veram et aeternam; <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sed has rursus dispellit gratia coelestis, sed et sedulitas <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>piorum, quae non cessat scrutari ipsam legem <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>domini, quam et ipse dominus deus opt. max. suis c<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ommendat regibus pollicens his omni se benedictionis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>genere benedicturum, si quidem ipsi soli adhaere<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ant et regna sua iuxta verbum illud legis lucidum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>gubernent.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Illam benedictionem a deo patre <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>per Iesum Christum R. V. M. imprecor, simul et omnia <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>mea offero obsequia.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dominus deus noster conservet S. R. <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>V. M. incolumem spirituque impellat suo, ut ali<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quando ad exemplum sacratissimorum regum <persName>Iosiae</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>et <persName>Constantini</persName> reformationem in ecclesiam synceram <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>et necessariam moliatur et perficiat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> in <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>primaria Helvetiorum urbe novembris 12. anno salutis nostrae 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Serenissimo potentissimoque principi <persName ref="p1825">Sigismundo Augusto</persName><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>, dei gratia <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>regi, magno duci <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName ref="l841">Lithuaniae</placeName>, <placeName ref="l859">Russiae</placeName>, <placeName ref="l2562">Pruss<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>iae</placeName>, <placeName ref="l700">Massoviae</placeName>, <placeName>Samoyitae</placeName> etc. domino et <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>haeredi, domino suo clementissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
